 Yu / Sin Chai Tung Shrine</a></h3><p>Red door and the community's faith</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="shrine" data-name="ศาลเจ้าปุนเถ่ากงอ๊า"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/pun-thao/"><img src="/assets/pun-thao.webp" alt="ศาลเจ้าปุนเถ่ากงอ๊า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">09</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Shrines & Vegetarian Halls</span><h3><a href="/en/places/pun-thao/">Pun Thao Kong A Shrine</a></h3><p>Faith in the old port area</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="shrine" data-name="ศาลเจ้ากู่ใช่ตึ๋ง"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/kue-chai/"><img src="/assets/kue-chai.webp" alt="ศาลเจ้ากู่ใช่ตึ๋ง" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">10</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Shrines & Vegetarian Halls</span><h3><a href="/en/places/kue-chai/">Kue Chai Tung Shrine</a></h3><p>A space for people's hopes</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="shrine" data-name="โรงเจในสวน"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/rong-jae/"><img src="/assets/rong-jae.webp" alt="โรงเจในสวน" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">11</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Shrines & Vegetarian Halls</span><h3><a href="/en/places/rong-jae/">The Shrine in the Garden</a></h3><p>Traditions passed down through places</p></div></article></div></section><aside class="source"><h2>Data Sources</h2><p>Compiled from<a href="https://www.takuapacity.go.th/pdf/travel-preview.pdf">Takua Pa Town Municipality brochure</a> · Data extracted September 6, 2026 (2569 BE). The document does not specify a publication date. Opening hours, shop status, and current schedules are not verified. Please check with the venue before traveling.</p></aside></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="footer-top"><a href="/en/" class="footer-name">Takua Pa <em>101</em></a><p>One city<br>Stories to get to know</p><a class="round-link" href="#main" aria-label="กลับขึ้นด้านบน">↑</a></div><div class="footer-bottom"><a href="https://siwaracafe.com/">Created by Baan Siwara, Takua Pa</a><span>Old Town Guide · Phang Nga Province</span><a href="https://www.takuapacity.go.th/pdf/travel-preview.pdf">Original Brochure ↗</a></div></footer><nav class="tabbar" aria-label="เมนูด่วน"><a href="/en/"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span>Home</a><a href="/en/map/"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">◈</span>Map</a><a href="/en/eat/"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">◉</span>Eat</a><a href="/en/trip/"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">◫</span>Trip<span class="qs-badge" data-trip-count hidden>0</span></a></nav></body></html>
